    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/59f0db37f5634d1a3ed14c093e8dd9b9.avif?t=1753462043\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/c8ba71dc54a1f8295850d6e54c55960b.poster.avif?t=1753462043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/c8ba71dc54a1f8295850d6e54c55960b.webm?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/c8ba71dc54a1f8295850d6e54c55960b.mp4?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/fbedc69a304ad46f708ca4981be93a89.avif?t=1753462043\" /></span>Decide what materials you need and offer quests to the adventurers around town for them to retrieve the items on your behalf. Just make sure you have enough gold to reward them for their work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/c4105c1750d2cb023f3ffd03e5802125.poster.avif?t=1753462043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/c4105c1750d2cb023f3ffd03e5802125.webm?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/c4105c1750d2cb023f3ffd03e5802125.mp4?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/ed762c467d177c9687aa60cfce2aed1c.avif?t=1753462043\" /></span>Once your quests have been fulfilled by intrepid adventurers, you can start crafting to create equipment like swords, bows, and armor to supply the denizens of town with what they need. Use tried and tested formulas or experiment to create something new!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/ef8fe639fc845c2f38225766c182eeec.poster.avif?t=1753462043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/ef8fe639fc845c2f38225766c182eeec.webm?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/ef8fe639fc845c2f38225766c182eeec.mp4?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/773c7a4a7924067df213192cd4ff2ffc.avif?t=1753462043\" /></span>Set your price and make the best decisions to get the most out of your transactions. Selling too high means players won\u2019t want to buy from you, but set prices too low and your profits suffer! Keep an eye on what items are hot and adjust accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/13555ab4d5fcad9f932ffa2c946ed902.poster.avif?t=1753462043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/13555ab4d5fcad9f932ffa2c946ed902.webm?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/13555ab4d5fcad9f932ffa2c946ed902.mp4?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/7575b139409e6c18e719106e4722f1d6.avif?t=1753462043\" /></span>Adventurers are always finding themselves at odds with all sorts of dangerous beasts and magical creatures. Help them succeed by providing them with the right equipment as they battle so their party can prevail against dangerous foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/26168f3ce631a209c07206e4caa4c937.poster.avif?t=1753462043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/26168f3ce631a209c07206e4caa4c937.webm?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/26168f3ce631a209c07206e4caa4c937.mp4?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/b258853ec6ebb5959e4311a038f4d404.avif?t=1753462043\" /></span>Craft items to decorate the town to in time to run events for players to enjoy. If you do well enough, you\u2019ll attract new players to the game, ensuring NPCville remains bustling and prosperous for the NPCs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/192fef0e64fb23f8df9b1dc8ed007bd6.poster.avif?t=1753462043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/192fef0e64fb23f8df9b1dc8ed007bd6.webm?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/192fef0e64fb23f8df9b1dc8ed007bd6.mp4?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/72e9de07e4d4d69102ce2d584ed4b5d8.avif?t=1753462043\" /></span>Certain actions can increase or decrease your Affinity with your fellow NPCs. Keep your Affinity growing to open up more opportunities for interactions and unlock side stories and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/1a91da2987ac0ce53739223bfdc66e77.poster.avif?t=1753462043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/1a91da2987ac0ce53739223bfdc66e77.webm?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/1a91da2987ac0ce53739223bfdc66e77.mp4?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/59f0db37f5634d1a3ed14c093e8dd9b9.avif?t=1753462043\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/c8ba71dc54a1f8295850d6e54c55960b.poster.avif?t=1753462043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/c8ba71dc54a1f8295850d6e54c55960b.webm?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/c8ba71dc54a1f8295850d6e54c55960b.mp4?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/fbedc69a304ad46f708ca4981be93a89.avif?t=1753462043\" /></span>Decide what materials you need and offer quests to the adventurers around town for them to retrieve the items on your behalf. Just make sure you have enough gold to reward them for their work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/c4105c1750d2cb023f3ffd03e5802125.poster.avif?t=1753462043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/c4105c1750d2cb023f3ffd03e5802125.webm?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/c4105c1750d2cb023f3ffd03e5802125.mp4?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/ed762c467d177c9687aa60cfce2aed1c.avif?t=1753462043\" /></span>Once your quests have been fulfilled by intrepid adventurers, you can start crafting to create equipment like swords, bows, and armor to supply the denizens of town with what they need. Use tried and tested formulas or experiment to create something new!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/ef8fe639fc845c2f38225766c182eeec.poster.avif?t=1753462043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/ef8fe639fc845c2f38225766c182eeec.webm?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/ef8fe639fc845c2f38225766c182eeec.mp4?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/773c7a4a7924067df213192cd4ff2ffc.avif?t=1753462043\" /></span>Set your price and make the best decisions to get the most out of your transactions. Selling too high means players won\u2019t want to buy from you, but set prices too low and your profits suffer! Keep an eye on what items are hot and adjust accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/13555ab4d5fcad9f932ffa2c946ed902.poster.avif?t=1753462043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447110/extras/13555ab4d5fcad9f932ffa2c946ed902.webm?t=1753462043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_